OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine across the region and
OL,7,Fthen dry overnight with prolonged
OL,8,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,9,FStaying warm in urban areas, with
OL,10,Flight winds for all.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,13,Fduring the morning under the strong
OL,14,FAugust sunshine. Winds mostly light,
OL,15,Fbut a little brisker near southern
OL,16,Fcoasts. Feeling very warm, locally hot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
