OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudier
OL,6,Fand fresher from Friday with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and perhaps the odd shower on
OL,8,FSaturday. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,9,FSunday, before clouding over from the
OL,10,Fwest late afternoon.
